        ex:hasText "Given our company's EcoVadis rating, carbon footprint, green hosting partners, digital sobriety practices, social commitments, AI ethics principles, and known sustainability trade-offs as of 2024, can our company's propose a solution that contributes to the client's environmental goals while ensuring business sustainability?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk152> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As of our company's reference year 2025, our company's, has a Silver EcoVadis rating, indicating a good level of commitment to corporate social responsibility. our company's have conducted a bilan carbone and cover scopes 1, 2, and main scope 3 items in our company's greenhouse gas assessment, including cloud inference. our company's also have a published trajectory to reduce carbon intensity per managed assistant year on year. our company's can propose hosting solutions through our company's green hosting partner, OuraneCloud, which is located in the EU region, uses renewable energy, has a power usage effectiveness of 1.2, and reuses heat." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk153> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This aligns with the client's goal of relying on low-carbon infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk154> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, our company's practice digital sobriety through model right-sizing, caching, and batching, which helps reduce energy consumption. our company's carbon reporting capability also allows our company's to monitor and report on the carbon footprint associated with our company's solutions, ensuring transparency and accountability in our company's environmental impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk155> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "While there may be trade-offs between high availability and energy consumption, as noted in our company's known CSR tensions, our company's can work with the client to find a balance that meets the client business needs while minimizing environmental impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk156> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For instance, presenting the more energy-intensive premium high-availability configuration along with the more energy-intensive premium high-availability configuration associated footprint makes the trade-off explicit. our company's commitment to social responsibilities, including being a signatory to the responsible tech charter and having gender balance and inclusion objectives, demonstrates our company's dedication to sustainability beyond just environmental considerations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk157> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company's AI ethics principles, which include transparency, bias monitoring, data minimization, and a documented data-use policy, ensure that our company's solutions are not only environmentally friendly but also socially responsible." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk158> a prov:Entity ;
